# Society Maintenance Tracker — Backend

This folder contains the backend API for the Society Maintenance Tracker application.

## Technology Stack

* FastAPI
* SQLAlchemy
* SQLite
* JWT Authentication
* Pydantic

## Features

* User registration and login
* JWT-based authentication
* Role-based authorization for residents and admins
* Maintenance management
* Complaint creation and tracking
* Complaint status updates
* Complaint status history
* Admin dashboard and complaint management

## Running the Backend

Install the required dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Start the FastAPI server:

```bash
uvicorn main:app --reload
```

The API will be available at:

```text
http://127.0.0.1:8000
```

API documentation is available through FastAPI Swagger UI:

```text
http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs
```

## Database

The backend uses SQLite with SQLAlchemy for database management.

Sensitive configuration values should be stored in environment variables and should not be committed to the repository.
